This task is to add command.sh file into .nddevice folder. This command.sh is executed @reboot from sudo crontab if /home/ubuntu/.nddevice/com_root file is present.

This command.sh can contains any command that has explicitely need to run that at some particular scenerios

This com_root file is created with this task and in the next reboot this script is executed and removes that com_reboot file to make the script runs only once 
------------------------------

Apart from this command.sh we also copy reboot_trigger.sh to .nddevice for onetimereboot service to run. Also copy onetimereboot.service file to /etc/systemd/system/

reboot_trigger will sleep for some time and does shutdown -r now to reboot the device.

After service file and script is copied, service is started with systemclt start.

